                "text": "Use the swapped form so the rectangular pulse is fixed on $0\\le \\tau\\le 3$ and the shifted exponential gives $\\tau\\le t$. There is no overlap for $t<0$, partial overlap from $0$ to $t$ for $0\\le t<3$, and full pulse overlap from $0$ to $3$ for $t\\ge 3$.",
                "latex": "",
                "image_slot_id": ""
