                "block_type": "display-math",
                "text": "",
                "latex": "0\\le t<3:\\quad \\int_0^t e^{-(t-\\tau)}\\,d\\tau=1-e^{-t},\\qquad t\\ge 3:\\quad \\int_0^3 e^{-(t-\\tau)}\\,d\\tau=e^{3-t}-e^{-t}",
